    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BUMP! Superbrawl, the newest PvP Free To Play game from Ubisoft, where strategic Planning meets explosive action !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUMP! Superbrawl is a 1v1 action-strategy game set in the utopian City of Arcadia, a vibrant home to mythical deities and legendary creatures from all over the world. Compete in the grand Superbrawl Tournament, where brains and brawn collide for ultimate glory and a shot at fulfilling your mythical purpose in the human world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fresh Take on 1v1 Battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a unique mix of fast-paced strategy and chaotic action:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Matches, Big Decisions: Engage in explosive 3-minute battles that keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneous Turns: Plan your moves, anticipate your opponent, and see the action unfold together in real-time!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and Adapt: Outsmart your rivals in time-limited rounds to take control of the arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVER 20 heroes to unlock!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and customize unique heroes inspired by global mythology\u2014from Greek titans to Japanese gods!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings distinct abilities, including basic, reactive, and passive skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate trio by combining four archetypes: Brawler, Dasher, Sniper, or Mage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5ce892c01cf5f483b01b9603a87314da.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is unique!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your adaptability in rotating PvP arenas with unique hazards and layouts!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match offers new surprises and challenges\u2014no two games are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise to glory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards, master the Road to Glory, and unlock powerful rewards in the BUMP Pass.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in exciting events, challenge your friends, and showcase your skills on BUMP TV.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the Superbrawl Tournament?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord to connect with other players and get the latest updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BUMP! Superbrawl, the newest PvP Free To Play game from Ubisoft, where strategic Planning meets explosive action !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5c5ca1510deb748e7f7d46394eb25153.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUMP! Superbrawl is a 1v1 action-strategy game set in the utopian City of Arcadia, a vibrant home to mythical deities and legendary creatures from all over the world. Compete in the grand Superbrawl Tournament, where brains and brawn collide for ultimate glory and a shot at fulfilling your mythical purpose in the human world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/f1e5dbb3b63e38f580324ae913381a2e.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fresh Take on 1v1 Battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a unique mix of fast-paced strategy and chaotic action:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Matches, Big Decisions: Engage in explosive 3-minute battles that keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneous Turns: Plan your moves, anticipate your opponent, and see the action unfold together in real-time!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and Adapt: Outsmart your rivals in time-limited rounds to take control of the arena.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/033d31aab739eccc9087bdc389c87726.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVER 20 heroes to unlock!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and customize unique heroes inspired by global mythology\u2014from Greek titans to Japanese gods!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings distinct abilities, including basic, reactive, and passive skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate trio by combining four archetypes: Brawler, Dasher, Sniper, or Mage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/5ce892c01cf5f483b01b9603a87314da.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is unique!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your adaptability in rotating PvP arenas with unique hazards and layouts!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match offers new surprises and challenges\u2014no two games are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise to glory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards, master the Road to Glory, and unlock powerful rewards in the BUMP Pass.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in exciting events, challenge your friends, and showcase your skills on BUMP TV.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.poster.avif?t=1738765228\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.webm?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887910/extras/e618ae5441e8a1e2c2215e4220999e92.mp4?t=1738765228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the Superbrawl Tournament?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord to connect with other players and get the latest updates.</p>",
